{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotions unfold in shaved ice, a journey of self-discovery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yume Kakigori is a unique visual novel featuring Japanese shaved ice and customer interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a shaved ice shop owner who has lost their ability to speak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the mysterious Raven, you will express yourself through shaved ice and gradually uncover the truths behind the characters and the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.poster.avif?t=1759136178\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.webm?t=1759136178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/1be5fa574104cca431bbb5d5d96c1967.mp4?t=1759136178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>By combining three syrups representing Emotion (Red), Desire (Yellow), and Thought (Blue), players create shaved ice symbolizing various feelings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shaved ice made by the player carries their thoughts and emotions, allowing them to connect with customers and learn more about their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/extras/a199d1f6793c54c913af22a823594f4d.avif?t=1759136178\" width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these visitors comes with their own unique backstory and hidden clues embedded in the documents you\u2019ll encounter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are invited to explore their stories and piece together the fragments of a mysterious universe. As they explore each customer's story, players will also confront their own emotions, embarking together on a journey of self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Would Your Color Affects their Destiny?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2795660?t=1759136178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759136178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/47eef50b4b0caa23091333c0a86713b3255bdb8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759136178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795660/47eef50b4b0caa23091333c0a86713b3255bdb8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759136178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2832090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotions unfold in shaved ice, a journey of self-discovery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yume Kakigori is a unique visual novel featuring Japanese shaved ice and customer interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a shaved ice shop owner who has lost their ability to speak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the mysterious Raven, you will express yourself through shaved ice and gradually uncover the truths behind the characters and the world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c